#. Description of the plugin
#: nectar-blocks.php
msgid ""
"Step into the future of WordPress with Nectarblocks, where innovation meets "
"seamless design. Unleash the full potential of your website by transforming "
"the core WordPress editor into a dynamic and robust full-site editor."
msgstr ""
"通过 Nectarblocks 迈向 WordPress 的未来，在这里创新与无缝设计完美融合。通过将 WordPress "
"核心编辑器转变为动态且强大的全站编辑器，释放您网站的全部潜力。"

